*----------------------------------------------------------------------
MAP    BSS  10
WORK   BSS  100
DSKSEC0 BSS 256          sector 0
DSKFDIR BSS 256          FDIR (sector 1 or subdir sectors)
FILESTAT BYTE 13
       TEXT 'File: '
